# Mock customer service — dev-only env overrides.
#
# Copy to `.env` in this folder and fill in your details when you want
# live calls or SMS to route through the demo to a phone you control.
# With this file absent (or these keys unset), the mock falls back to
# Dana Demo / +15551239999 (555 reserved range — will never route
# anywhere real).
#
# scripts/start-mock-server.sh sources this file before spawning tsx,
# so no dotenv package is needed on the mock's side.

# The focal customer — used by the calendar fixture and the "calling to
# check on my orders" demo path. Alice/Bob/Carol/Pat/purchaser stay as
# behavior fixtures for the refund-eligibility procedure and are not
# configurable here.
DEMO_CUSTOMER_NAME=Dana
DEMO_CUSTOMER_SURNAME=Demo
DEMO_CUSTOMER_PHONE=+15551239999

# Optional: override the port (default 7400). The crm drop-in reaches
# this service via MOCK_CUSTOMERS_URL=http://localhost:${PORT}.
# PORT=7400
